    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Dead jobs (24 h)",
      "description": "Jobs whose retries ran out in the last 24 h, counted in rf.jobs AND rf.jobs_history (the upkeep archives finished jobs after 5 min, so a dead one stays counted for the whole day). Find them with make psql: rf.jobs_history where status is dead, newest first; read last_error. Alert: the count rises.",
